{"id":"39322da73a94b6b8","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-genericity.md","title":"稠密串集、n泛型与弱n泛型","display":"df-genericity — 稠密串集、n泛型与弱n泛型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-genericity","aliases":["43-df-genericity"],"display":"df-genericity — 稠密串集、n泛型与弱n泛型","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefix]]","[[43-df-sigman]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 11.15.3; Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7","source_printed_pages":"286–287","source_pdf_pages":"306–307","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-genericity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-genericity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-genericity — 稠密串集、n泛型与弱n泛型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"af898f828e135b93\" href=\"?note=af898f828e135b93\" title=\"43-df-sigman\">43-df-sigman</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.15.3; Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"286–287"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"306–307"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_n\">\\(\\Sigma^0_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"af898f828e135b93\" href=\"?note=af898f828e135b93\" title=\"43-df-sigman\">43-df-sigman</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限串集族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\\coloneqq\\{V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in V\\}\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_n\\coloneqq\\{V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in V\\}\\in\\Sigma^0_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\iff\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Avoids}(X,V)\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;\\neg(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Avoids}(X,V)\\iff\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq X\\land\\forall\\tau\\in V\\;\\neg(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq\\tau)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\lor\\operatorname{Avoids}(X,V)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NGeneric}(X,n)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\lor\\operatorname{Avoids}(X,V)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,n)\\iff\\forall V\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用书中Theorem 11.15.3的等价串集刻画，不复制草稿中否定符号错排的forcing递归。Avoids要求某个初段的整个锥没有V中的延伸，远强于“没有V成员恰好等于该初段”。本项只定义无oracle版本；没有暗中把n与oracle相对化混用。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.15.3; Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7，印刷页286–287，PDF页306–307。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigman","status":"resolved","id":"af898f828e135b93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sigman]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\sqsubseteq$、$\\Sigma^0_n$、$\\#_2$ 分别采用 [[43-df-prefix]]、[[43-df-sigman]]、[[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\mathcal S_n$ 为下式定义的有限串集族。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigman","status":"resolved","id":"af898f828e135b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\sqsubseteq$、$\\Sigma^0_n$、$\\#_2$ 分别采用 [[43-df-prefix]]、[[43-df-sigman]]、[[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\mathcal S_n$ 为下式定